/* Steering, HOW TO TUNE:

The number on the left is the speed that correlates to the angle on the right.

If the values are (20f, 40f), that means at 20 m/s the maximum steering angle is 40 degrees.

By default there are 3 points, but you can add as many as you want.
*/


